121Extract your internal Google Cloud project parameters dynamically, construct the Artifact Registry repository, 
configure Docker's secure handshake, and dispatch the asset.

Code:
//Change the parameters accordingly.
//Parameters include project id, repository name, tag name, and the region.
# Create the repository in us-central1
gcloud artifacts repositories create valkyrie-docker-repo \
    --repository-format=docker \
    --location=us-us-east1                                            

# Authenticate Docker for us-central1
gcloud auth configure-docker us-east1-docker.pkg.dev

# Tag the image with your exact project details
docker tag valkyrie-prod:v0.0.1 us-east1-docker.pkg.dev/qwiklabs-gcp-03-c3d8f087d4b3/valkyrie-repository/valkyrie-prod:v0.0.1

# Push image to your registry
docker push us-east1-docker.pkg.dev/qwiklabs-gcp-03-c3d8f087d4b3/valkyrie-repository/valkyrie-prod:v0.0.1



